# Ajani, Nacatl Avenger's 0: "Create a 2/1 white Cat Warrior creature token. When you do, if you control a red
# permanent other than Ajani, he deals damage ..." (CR 603.12, 603.4). Ajani is red and white himself, but "other than
# Ajani" leaves him out, so with nothing else red the token is made and the reflexive trigger never goes on the
# stack. Setup: Bot1's Cat dies to Lightning Bolt on turn 4 and Ajani transforms; on turn 5 Bot1 uses the 0.

